<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Codeforces Upsolve Planner</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body class="landing">
  <main class="hero-card">
    <div class="brand-mark">&lt;/&gt;</div>
    <p class="eyebrow">SMART PRACTICE, BETTER RESULTS</p>
    <h1>Your next solved problem<br>is already waiting.</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Turn your Codeforces submission history into a focused, rating-sorted upsolve plan.</p>
    <form class="handle-form" action="/planner" method="get">
      <label for="handle">Codeforces handle</label>
      <div class="input-row"><input id="handle" name="handle" placeholder="e.g. tourist" required autocomplete="username"><button type="submit">Build my plan <span>→</span></button></div>
    </form>
    <p class="hint">We only read public Codeforces submissions. No account connection needed.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
